  "title": "Grilled Chicken and Charred Corn Salad",
  "description": "Charred corn, chicken breasts, and asparagus go straight from the grill into this sensational summer salad with tomatoes, romaine lettuce, and a simple dressing.",
  "authors": [
    "Dawn"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-05-11T01:38:43-04:00",
